1
00:00:06,300 --> 00:00:09,590
This tea really is delicious.

2
00:00:10,240 --> 00:00:13,530
Ah, Akie!

3
00:00:18,140 --> 00:00:22,780
Hm? Oh, you're all here too.
Over here!

4
00:00:27,360 --> 00:00:30,480
- Wh-what are you doing, Akie?
- What do you mean?

5
00:00:31,900 --> 00:00:35,580
I'm having some lovely tea and cake.

6
00:00:36,560 --> 00:00:38,060
Would you all like some?

7
00:00:38,580 --> 00:00:43,250
I can't finish a cake this big
all by myself.

8
00:00:44,180 --> 00:00:50,590
Heh heh. I won't let you interrupt
my precious time with Akie!

